    "detailed_description": "<h1>WARNING!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The game was developed by one person, bugs, an empty world and low fps are possible!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2v6 PvP Survival Horror. No Mercy. No Second Chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone quiet\u2014but the hunt has begun. Two players take control of ruthless, bloodthirsty dinosaurs. The other six? Just human. Unarmed. Terrified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a human, you\u2019ve got one goal: survive the 3-minute countdown until rescue. Hide. Run. Outsmart the monsters stalking you. Make one wrong move, and it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a dinosaur, there\u2019s no sympathy\u2014only instinct. Track them. Rip them apart. Leave none alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the humans die, the hunt ends in victory. But if even one escapes\u2026 humanity wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a fight for your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2v6 PvP Survival Horror. No Mercy. No Second Chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world\u2019s gone quiet\u2014but the hunt has begun. Two players take control of ruthless, bloodthirsty dinosaurs. The other six? Just human. Unarmed. Terrified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a human, you\u2019ve got one goal: survive the 3-minute countdown until rescue. Hide. Run. Outsmart the monsters stalking you. Make one wrong move, and it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a dinosaur, there\u2019s no sympathy\u2014only instinct. Track them. Rip them apart. Leave none alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the humans die, the hunt ends in victory. But if even one escapes\u2026 humanity wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a fight for your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
